      "releaseNotes": "• Redesigned \"My Places\" — with Favorites subfolders, pinned folders, and quicker actions\n• Rebuilt \"Plan a Route\" — add route and POI points, and combine different route types\n• New Astronomy plugin: star map with a detailed database for each object, visibility graphs, and an observation schedule\n• Added \"Terrain shadows\" visualization type\n• Added support for Road-only maps\n• Edit the color palette for Tracks and Terrain\n• Auto-organize tracks by year, length, activity, and more\n• Split multi-track GPX files into separate files on import\n• Set a default appearance for Track folders\n• Added a bicycle width setting to avoid narrow cycleways\n• Added an OBD-II adapter voltage widget\n• Added a \"Pause spoken audio\" option to pause podcasts or audiobooks during navigation instructions\n• Full icon selection now available for profiles\n• Improved performance when managing a large number of Favorites\n• Fixed an issue with the CarPlay trial period",
